"祜樂山水，每風景，必造峴山，置酒言詠，終日不倦。嘗慨然歎息，顧謂從事中郎鄒湛等曰：「自有宇宙，便有此山。由來賢達勝士，登此遠望，如我與卿者多矣！皆湮滅無聞，使人悲傷。如百歲後有知，魂魄猶應登此也。」湛曰：「公德冠四海，道嗣前哲，令聞令望，必與此山俱傳。至若湛輩，乃當如公言耳。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","source_position":{"raw_start":4069,"raw_end":4210,"raw_character_offsets":[4071,4072,4073,4074,4075,4076,4077,4078,4079,4080,4081,4082,4083,4084,4085,4086,4087,4088,4089,4090,4091,4092,4093,4094,4095,4096,4097,4098,4099,4100,4101,4102,4103,4104,4105,4106,4107,4108,4109,4110,4111,4112,4113,4114,4115,4116,4117,4118,4119,4120,4121,4122,4123,4124,4125,4126,4127,4128,4129,4130,4131,4132,4133,4134,4135,4136,4137,4138,4139,4140,4141,4142,4143,4144,4145,4146,4147,4148,4149,4150,4151,4152,4153,4154,4155,4156,4157,4158,4159,4160,4161,4162,4163,4164,4165,4166,4167,4168,4169,4170,4171,4172,4173,4174,4175,4176,4177,4178,4179,4180,4181,4182,4183,4184,4185,4186,4187,4188,4189,4190,4191,4192,4193,4194,4195,4196,4197,4198,4199,4200,4201,4202,4203,4204,4205,4206,4207,4208,4209],"first_line":54,"last_line":54,"revision_id":2567662,"projection_sha256":"12dcb53897fbdaa68f93799fb8918bb7a01692e55d530d1221a18c53afbb305a","source_layer":"received_biography","editorial_subsection":" [[作者:羊祜|羊祜]] ","quotation_block_markup":false},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p024:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"祜","kind":"person","person_id":"dqd_5q9_pkz_BD","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p024:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"鄒湛","kind":"person","person_id":"7vi_mu0_5sk","status":"source_explicit"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p024:m0099","start":99,"end":100,"surface":"湛","kind":"person","person_id":"7vi_mu0_5sk","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p024:m0103","start":103,"end":104,"surface":"公","kind":"person","person_id":"dqd_5q9_pkz_BD","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p024:m0128","start":128,"end":129,"surface":"湛","kind":"person","person_id":"7vi_mu0_5sk","status":"contextual"},{"id":"c-jinshu-034-yanghu:p024:m0134","start":134,"end":135,"surface":"公","kind":"person